(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-31","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["叶澄做了个[[wise|明智的]]决定：让检测员[[convey|运送]]样品，而不交给基金车。[[triangular|三角形的]]旧院聚着一群[[youth|青年]]义工，老陈手臂[[muscle|肌肉]]还痛，只负责看路。有一箱原作[[tuberculosis|肺结核]]筛查的旧仪器，他们以为与水无关，[[youthful|年轻的]]负责人准备搬走。叶澄查看原[[design|设计]]，发现里面放的却是抽样管，和送给居民的[[turnip|芜菁]]分装在一起。这不是小伙子们该独自承担的[[accountability|责任]]，我们先阻止再分发，给每件东西留下原来摆放的位置，免得第二天又没人能说它从哪里来。","坏设备混入好物有这种[[possibility|可能性]]，但援助急就不等于错误[[unavoidable|不可避免]]。洗菜台的[[garlic|大蒜]]盖不住沟边气味，一名义工因疲倦几乎[[unconscious|失去意识]]，[[chief|负责人]]让他去休息，不再说[[unfit|不合格]]。墙画上的[[aircraft|飞机]]象征远援，器材[[utilization|利用]]却要靠现场检验。取样器的[[automatic|自动的]]标注不可靠，实际要人工开阀。叶澄把流向[[vector|矢量]]重新画给检测员，我第一次听她讲不用替基金辩解的技术说明；她说知道设备能做什么，也该承认它不能做什么。","检测员对旧标记仍[[doubtful|怀疑]]，取样口有[[viscous|粘稠的]]沉积。[[despite|尽管]]一只[[wasp|黄蜂]]在旁飞，他也不急着扒开[[opening|孔口]]。罐头看起来[[wholesome|有益健康]]，隔壁却堆[[industrial|工业的]]弃管；两种物资不能只用一朵[[wreath|花环]]区分。我们[[obey|遵守]]他的隔离要求，让义工将鸡蛋[[yolk|蛋黄]]洒过的台子另清理，再[[conduct|进行]]采样。现场没有谁听一听就明白危险，程雾守住器材边界，老陈看着孩子别靠近，检测员按自己的步骤做，我们尽量不给他添新的混乱。","宣传图的水源[[fantastic|极好的]]，院里收得[[tidy|整齐]]也不能证明水净。一场小[[incident|事件]]改变取样安排：木架[[decay|腐朽]]后塌下，切断了备用[[supply|供应]]软管。义工没有随意[[liberty|放肆]]修接，知道脆管[[liable|易于]]再破。沟面漂着[[drift|漂流]]的泡沫，检测员说每个[[element|成分]]要分析，别在[[chaos|混乱]]里猜它毒性。我以前以为替[[mankind|人类]]做大事才叫帮助，今天却把挡路的一块木板搬开，守着取样员不被旁人碰到，事情一样有实际分量。","水量[[abundant|充足]]，采样仍按缓慢[[pace|节奏]]。天气员认为[[probable|很可能]]有雨，[[forecast|预报]]促使我们早撤设备。叶澄要[[uncover|揭开]]旧漆层，由巡查员监督，只看编号不刮残渣。她把所有物品[[pack|打包]]登记，将旧编号[[input|输入]]现场表。一声提示[[cue|信号]]响起，取样器完成两路分采。旧漆下面不是检验合格牌，而是B-17回收牌；基金把它改成了U3清洁工程。蓝线箱再次出现，意义却变了：不是里面每一件东西都坏，而是整批东西的来历被一层更安心的名字盖住。","两路样品编号分别是U3-W与G1-W，后者取自旧厂方向沟；这是取样地点标签，不是检验结论。程雾把铆牌、取样和封签的时间对齐，何警官联系独立实验室。叶澄承认她曾以为换名只是让居民愿意接受旧设备，却没想到源头也被混说。她告诉我，最初那份B-17记录不在档案站，原厂有一段设备交接音带。我们不能马上赶厂，得等样品和水向互证；明天先去接收样品的学校，确定它们没有在援助车上又换一次身份。"],"en":["Ye chose the [[wise|wise]] course: technicians would [[convey|convey]] samples independently. In a [[triangular|triangular]] yard, volunteer [[youth|youth]] gathered. Chen's painful [[muscle|muscles]] limited him to routes. A [[youthful|youthful]] leader would remove old [[tuberculosis|tuberculosis]] screening equipment, supposedly unrelated to water. Its [[design|design]] label concealed sampling tubes beside donated [[turnip|turnips]]. This [[accountability|accountability]] was not theirs alone. We halted distribution and recorded original positions so origins would remain answerable tomorrow.","Bad items could enter good stock: a real [[possibility|possibility]], not [[unavoidable|unavoidable]] urgency. [[garlic|Garlic]] masked no ditch smell. A tired, nearly [[unconscious|unconscious]] volunteer rested at the [[chief|chief]]'s request rather than be called [[unfit|unfit]]. A wall [[aircraft|aircraft]] symbolized distant aid, but [[utilization|utilization]] required inspection. An [[automatic|automatic]] sampler label concealed manual valves. Ye redrew the flow [[vector|vector]], explaining both capacities and limits without defending the fund.","The [[doubtful|doubtful]] technician examined [[viscous|viscous]] sediment. [[despite|Despite]] a [[wasp|wasp]], he did not force the [[opening|opening]]. [[wholesome|Wholesome]]-looking cans stood beside [[industrial|industrial]] pipes. A [[wreath|wreath]] could not distinguish them. We would [[obey|obey]] separation requests, cleaning a different table stained with [[yolk|yolk]], then [[conduct|conduct]] sampling. Cheng guarded equipment boundaries and Chen kept children away. Nobody could identify risk by listening; we supported the technician's steps without adding disorder.","A [[fantastic|fantastic]] source image and [[tidy|tidy]] yard established no purity. An [[incident|incident]] interrupted work: rack [[decay|decay]] broke a reserve [[supply|supply]] hose. Volunteers took no [[liberty|liberty]] with repairs; brittle pipes were [[liable|liable]] to split. Foam would [[drift|drift]] past, every [[element|element]] requiring analysis, not guesses in [[chaos|chaos]]. I once imagined helping [[mankind|mankind]] meant grand acts. Moving a board and protecting the sampler had practical worth too.","[[abundant|Abundant]] flow did not change the sampling [[pace|pace]]. [[probable|Probable]] rain in the [[forecast|forecast]] urged equipment withdrawal. Under supervision Ye would [[uncover|uncover]] numbers beneath paint, not scrape residue. We would [[pack|pack]] and [[input|input]] records. A [[cue|cue]] marked completed separate samples. Beneath the new paint lay a B-17 return plate renamed U3 clean works. Every object was not necessarily defective; a reassuring identity concealed an entire batch's origins.","U3-W and G1-W named sampling locations, the latter the factory-facing ditch, not results. Cheng aligned plate, sampling and seals; He contacted an independent laboratory. Ye once thought renaming made reused equipment acceptable, never anticipating concealed sources. An original B-17 record included a factory handover tape. We could not rush there before checking samples against flow. Tomorrow we would visit the receiving school and ensure samples had not changed identity again aboard an aid vehicle."]});
